    "The Cathedral of Insanity is designed as a party endgame encounter, with a measured battlefield, sealed chambers, dangerous routes, and a final arena waiting beyond the last guardian.": "瘋狂大教堂設計為組隊終局挑戰，有精心規劃的戰場、被封印的房間、危險的路線，以及在最後一位守衛之後等待的終極競技場。",
    "Its monsters, effects, sounds, and boss abilities are being integrated into the native 3.63C client so the encounter feels like a true part of Aden, not a separate game bolted onto it.": "它的怪物、特效、音效與 Boss 技能正在整合進原生 3.63C 客戶端，讓這場挑戰像是亞丁真正的一部分，而不是硬接上去的另一款遊戲。",
    "Break the seals": "打破封印",
    "Open the Sanctuary room by room. Each guardian is a gate between your party and the final confrontation.": "一間一間打開聖所。每位守衛都是你的隊伍與最終對決之間的一道門。",
    "Survive the fire": "撐過烈火",
    "Lightning, flame, bone, and pressure fill the battlefield. Positioning matters as much as damage.": "閃電、火焰、白骨與壓迫感充滿戰場。站位與傷害同樣重要。",
    "Face Big Red": "面對 Big Red",
    "When the inner rooms fall silent, the Lord of Insanity arrives with original movement, attacks, casting, and death sequences.": "當內室歸於寂靜，瘋狂之王帶著原版的移動、攻擊、施法與死亡演出降臨。",
    "FROM THE BUILD": "開發中畫面",
    "THE SANCTUARY OF EVIL": "邪惡聖所",
    "A FIRST GLIMPSE": "初次一瞥",
    "The fire is": "火焰",
    "already moving.": "已經在蔓延。",
    "This is an early look at the visual direction. The encounter is still being tested, tuned, and expanded, including its boss animation set and native effects.": "這是視覺方向的早期預覽。這場挑戰仍在測試、調整與擴充中，包括 Boss 動畫與原生特效。",
    "The map is not a public shortcut or a replacement for the worlds you already play. It is a new descent for parties ready to earn the way forward.": "這張地圖不是公開的捷徑，也不是你現有世界的替代品。它是為準備好憑實力前進的隊伍所設的全新下探之路。",
    "DURANCE OF HATE": "憎恨的囚牢",
    "THE ROAD THERE": "通往那裡的路",
    "Every step": "每一步",
    "costs blood.": "都要流血。",
    "Before the Hellgate opens, parties have to fight their way down through the Durance of Hate, where Blood Lords guard the halls and every pull tests the whole group.": "在地獄之門開啟前，隊伍必須殺出重圍穿過憎恨的囚牢，那裡有血腥領主守著大廳，每一次引怪都在考驗整個隊伍。",
    "Beyond the Durance lie the Hellgate, the River of Flame and, at the end of it all, the Sanctuary.": "囚牢之後是地獄之門、火焰之河，而一切的盡頭就是聖所。",
