    "+2 SP ≈ +19% spell base damage": "+2 SP ≈ 魔法基礎傷害 +19%",
    "Physical and magic, PvP and PvE.": "物理與魔法、PvP 與 PvE。",
    "It reduces the pain of the target.": "減輕目標的痛苦。",
    "Invisible Targets": "隱形目標",
    "It makes the target panic. Each of the Stats decrease by 1.": "使目標恐慌。各項能力值減少 1。",
    "+10 damage on every hit and spell · You take × 1.2": "每次命中與魔法傷害 +10 · 你承受 × 1.2",
    "Grants the illusion of an Ogre's strength: +4 damage and +4 hit for melee and bow attacks.": "賦予歐吉之力的幻覺：近戰與弓箭攻擊傷害 +4、命中 +4。",
    "Grants the illusion of a Lich's power, raising spell power (SP) by 2.": "賦予巫妖之力的幻覺：魔法攻擊力（SP）提升 2 點。",
    "Grants the illusion of a Diamond Golem's hide, improving AC by 20.": "賦予鑽石高崙外皮的幻覺：AC 改善 20 點。",
    "Grants the illusion of an Avatar's might: +10 damage on melee, bow and spell attacks, but you take 20% more damage while it lasts.": "賦予化身之力的幻覺：近戰、弓箭與魔法攻擊傷害 +10，但在持續期間內受到的傷害增加 20%。",
    "-15 Fire resistance and periodic MR-reduced fire damage: against monsters 20 + 0.75 × SP every 4 seconds (SP counts up to 50)": "火屬性抗性 -15，並週期性造成受魔防減免的火焰傷害：對怪物每 4 秒 20 + 0.75 × SP（SP 最多計 50）",
    "Fire damage vs monsters": "對怪物的火焰傷害",
    "20 + 0.75 × SP every 4 seconds": "每 4 秒 20 + 0.75 × SP",
    "SP counts up to 50, and the target's MR reduces it. Against players each cycle stays 20.": "SP 最多計 50，目標的魔防會減免。對玩家時每次固定 20。",
    "Sharpens the target's concentration: +4 MP regeneration while it lasts.": "提升目標的專注力：持續期間 MP 恢復 +4。",
    "← ALL CLASSES": "← 所有職業",
    "Heavy frontliner specializing in melee control and survivability.": "重型前線，專精近戰控場與生存。",
