    "Automatically awarded when the level bracket is completed.": "達到該等級區間時自動給予。",
    "Red Knight's Hood": "紅騎士頭巾",
    "Shield of Red Knight": "紅騎士盾牌",
    "Belt of Bravery": "勇敢皮帶",
    "All classes": "所有職業",
    "Explore your spells and their original animations.": "探索你的魔法與原版動畫。",
    "Find a spell": "搜尋魔法",
    "All spells": "所有魔法",
    "Heal, Water": "治癒、水",
    "Reuse": "冷卻時間",
    "Element": "屬性",
    "HP will slightly recover by healing the target. It will have an adverse effect when it's used on Undead monster.": "治癒目標，少量恢復 HP。對不死系怪物使用會有反效果。",
    "▷ View animation": "▷ 觀看動畫",
    "Grant": "給予",
    "Creates a light source as bright as a lantern, illuminating the user's environment.": "製造如提燈般明亮的光源，照亮使用者周圍。",
    "Changes illumination; no separate cast animation.": "改變照明；沒有獨立的施法動畫。",
    "Change": "變化",
    "Add 2 bonus points to AC for the user to enhance defense.": "為使用者增加 2 點 AC 加成以提升防禦。",
    "E Bolt": "光箭",
    "Attack, Beam": "攻擊、光束",
    "Causes damages on the target by emitting pure magical energy.": "放出純粹的魔法能量對目標造成傷害。",
    "Teleport": "指定傳送",
    "Move(teleport) to a random location. However, with the use of the 'Ring of Teleport Control', it's possible to teleport to any location in the saved places by 'Memory Command.'": "移動（傳送）到隨機地點。使用「傳送控制戒指」時，可傳送到以「記憶座標」儲存的任何地點。",
    "Attack, Water": "攻擊、水",
    "Damages the target by throwing daggers made of ice.": "投擲冰製的匕首對目標造成傷害。",
    "Attack, Wind": "攻擊、風",
    "After creating a toothed wheel by manipulating the wind, will damage the target with it.": "操縱風製造出齒輪，並以此對目標造成傷害。",
    "+1 melee damage vs undead": "對不死系近戰傷害 +1",
    "Also +1 hit on any target. Counts as weapon bonus, so Elemental Fire and Burning Spirit multiply it. One weapon spell at a time: Holy, Enchant, Bless Weapon and Shadow Fang replace each other.": "對任何目標也有 +1 命中。算作武器加成，所以屬性之火與燃燒鬥志會乘上它。武器魔法同時只能有一種：神聖武器、擬似魔法武器、祝福魔法武器與暗影之牙會互相取代。",
    "Bestow a sacred spell on the target's close range weapon. The weapon bestowed by Holy Weapon Magic can do additional harm to an undead monster.": "對目標的近戰武器施加神聖魔法。被神聖武器魔法加持的武器可對不死系怪物造成額外傷害。",
    "Swing a two-handed sword widely to damage opponent. Damaged opponent will be stunned at a certain percentage. This skill may be used only if equipped with a two-handed sword.": "大幅揮舞雙手劍對敵人造成傷害。受傷的敵人有一定機率被暈眩。只有裝備雙手劍時才能使用。",
    "Damage taken": "承受傷害",
    "Each hit −(1 + (Level − 50) ÷ 5)": "每次命中 −(1 + (等級 − 50) ÷ 5)",
    "−1 at Lv 50, −3 at 60, −5 at 70, −7 at 80. Physical and magic damage.": "50 級 −1、60 級 −3、70 級 −5、80 級 −7。物理與魔法傷害皆適用。",
    "Contain mental strength on equipped armor by a knight to absorb damage caused by an opponent's attack. As level increases, more damage may be absorbed.": "騎士將精神力注入裝備的盔甲，吸收敵人攻擊造成的傷害。等級越高，吸收的傷害越多。",
    "The strong surface of the armor that has the will of the Knight blocks the opponent's attack and damages the opponent's weapon at a certain percentage.": "承載騎士意志的堅硬盔甲表面會擋下敵人的攻擊，並有一定機率損傷敵人的武器。",
    "Concentrates on Shield to block long-range attack of enemies. This skill may be used only if equipped with a shield.": "專注於盾牌以格擋敵人的遠距攻擊。只有裝備盾牌時才能使用。",
    "Counter damage": "反擊傷害",
    "(2H sword max damage + Enchant + Weapon bonus) × 2": "（雙手劍最大傷害 + 強化 + 武器加成）× 2",
    "Chance 20% + your level − attacker's level (+ up to 4% from base INT), max 40%. Blocks the melee hit; only two-handed swords hit back.": "機率 20% + 你的等級 − 攻擊者等級（基礎 INT 最多再 +4%），上限 40%。格擋近戰攻擊；只有雙手劍會反擊。",
    "Concentrates to evade attack of enemy and counterattacks by the enemy. At this point, by using the force of the opponent, attack power will be doubled. This skill may be used only if equipped with a two-handed sword.": "集中精神閃避敵人的攻擊並反擊。此時借用對手的力量，攻擊力加倍。只有裝備雙手劍時才能使用。",
    "No spells match. Try another name or level.": "沒有符合的魔法。試試其他名稱或等級。",
