    "For knights,": "對騎士而言，",
    "Original DEX 13-14 gives +1 AC": "初始 DEX 13-14 給 +1 AC",
    "Original DEX 15+ gives +3 AC": "初始 DEX 15 以上給 +3 AC",
    ". Adding DEX later does not improve that original AC bonus.": "。之後加 DEX 不會提高該初始 AC 加成。",
    "Knight Naked AC Formula": "騎士裸裝 AC 公式",
    "Naked AC is not shown directly in the tables. For knights it is:": "表格沒有直接顯示裸裝 AC。騎士的算法是：",
