    "Direct-damage magic scales from INT plus item and buff SP, so raising INT can increase spell damage even across SP plateaus.": "直接傷害魔法取決於智力加上裝備與輔助魔法提供的 SP，因此即使 SP 暫時沒有提升，增加智力仍可提高魔法傷害。",
    "Debuff landing, healing, and special spells use their own rules, so the SP number is not the full story for a Mage.": "負面狀態命中、治療與特殊魔法各自有獨立的計算規則，因此面板上的 SP 數值並非魔法師的全部。",
    "Fills your own weapon attacks with magic for 30 minutes, as if your weapon were one enchant higher and made of silver.": "使自身武器攻擊附帶魔法效果 30 分鐘，如同武器強化值 +1 且具備銀材質特性。",
