    "Mana duelist": "魔力決鬥者",
    "Nothing Left to Take": "無可再取",
    "Mind Break deals 15% more damage when its target starts the cast below 20% MP.": "目標施放時 MP 低於 20%，心靈破壞傷害增加 15%。",
    "Transfers no extra MP. Targets with zero maximum MP do not qualify.": "不額外轉移 MP。最大 MP 為零的目標不適用。",
    "Risk and recovery": "風險與恢復",
    "Pain with a Purpose": "有目的的痛",
    "After Joy of Pain removes HP from a monster, recover 15% of its applied damage as HP, up to 60 HP.": "疼痛的歡愉對怪物造成 HP 損失後，以其實際傷害的 15% 恢復 HP，最多 60 HP。",
    "Once per 10 seconds. Damage still uses your real missing HP; no PvP healing bonus.": "每 10 秒一次。傷害仍以你實際損失的 HP 計算；PvP 沒有治癒加成。",
