    "NPC pages in Korean or Traditional Chinese for the Windows client. Extract the zip into your Lineage folder: its": "Windows 客戶端的韓文或繁體中文 NPC 頁面。把 zip 解壓縮到你的 Lineage 資料夾：裡面的",
    "folder goes next to the game. Most pages are an unofficial machine translation; where the original client's translation still matches, that is used. A few pages stay in English. The launcher may put English back on pages it updates, so extract the pack again after an update. To go back to English, delete these files from the": "資料夾要放在遊戲旁邊。大多數頁面是非官方的機器翻譯；原客戶端的翻譯仍相符的部分則沿用。少數頁面維持英文。啟動器更新頁面時可能把英文放回去，更新後請再解壓縮一次。要改回英文，請從",
