    "Dragon Teeth earned since the revamp: hard mode hunting, pulled teeth and Dragon-Tooth Wardens, collapsed Koma Breaches and the Voice of the Sleeper. Ranked by Teeth earned. Standard world.": "改版後獲得的 Dragon Teeth：困難模式狩獵、拔下的龍牙與 Dragon-Tooth Warden、坍塌的 Koma Breach 以及 Voice of the Sleeper。依獲得的 Teeth 排名。標準世界。",
