    "Hard mode kills, boss kills, EXP and deaths in Dragon Valley Dungeon since {*}. Each tier is ranked on its own; All adds a character's tiers together. Ranked by kills (a boss counts twice), then EXP.": "自 {*} 起在龍之谷地監的困難模式擊殺、Boss 擊殺、經驗值與死亡。每個階級各自排名；「All」會把角色各階級加總。依擊殺數排名（Boss 算兩次），其次是經驗值。",
    "The Shrine's rarest gifts wake as the whole server silences the Voice of the Sleeper during the week, counted from Monday, New York time. The Voice has been silenced {n} times this week.": "整個伺服器在本週（自紐約時間週一起算）讓 Voice of the Sleeper 沉默，神殿最稀有的賜物便會甦醒。本週 Voice 已被沉默 {n} 次。",
