    "This uses the live formulas from the game server enchant code, not a made-up frontend rate table. Normal, blessed, and cursed armor/weapon scroll behavior is based on the same rules the server uses.": "這使用遊戲伺服器強化程式碼的即時公式，而不是自行編造的前端機率表。一般、受祝福與受詛咒的防具／武器卷軸行為都依伺服器的規則。",
