    "10 Standard lanes and 2 Classic lanes, up to 10 players each. Each lane adjusts to the number of players in it (1–10), checked continuously. Standard and Classic play separately.": "10 條標準戰線與 2 條經典戰線，每條最多 10 人。每條戰線會依其中的人數（1–10）持續調整難度。標準與經典分開進行。",
