    "60 seconds of your own activity plus 1,000 damage (less when an encounter has little HP to go around), 800 healing of allies a monster recently hit, or lighting all 3 lanterns. Pet and summon damage counts while you are acting yourself. Standing idle earns nothing.": "自己活動 60 秒，再加上 1,000 傷害（遭遇戰總 HP 不多時門檻會降低）、對剛被怪物攻擊的隊友治癒 800，或點亮全部 3 盞燈籠。你自己有在行動時，寵物與召喚獸的傷害也算。站著不動什麼都拿不到。",
