    "One boss for every two players in each wave; the next wave comes when the current one falls. Bosses hit at a quarter of their normal strength.": "每波每兩名玩家一隻 Boss；目前這波倒下後下一波才來。Boss 的攻擊力只有正常的四分之一。",
