    "Death Knight and Demon Vanguards, Fafurion, Valakas, Antharas, Lindvior, and a surprise coastal Kraken can lead the invasion. Standard and Classic receive separate, correctly scaled encounters. Full commander rewards are limited per web profile each day.": "死亡騎士與惡魔先鋒、法利昂、巴拉卡斯、安塔瑞斯、林德拜爾，以及突襲海岸的克拉肯都可能率領入侵。標準與經典各有獨立、正確調整強度的遭遇戰。完整的指揮官獎勵每個網站帳號模式每日有上限。",
