    "Hallow.": "萬聖節。",
    "The Haunted Hallow opens: the Ancient Curse every half hour, Blood Moon riders, a Haunted House and the Headless Horseman at Giran's gate. Join free from the Pumpkin Trader in any town: three hours a day for each character.": "鬧鬼萬聖節開幕：每半小時一次古老詛咒、血月騎士、鬼屋，以及奇岩城門前的無頭騎士。在任一城鎮的南瓜商人處免費參加：每個角色每天三小時。",
