    "Talk to the Pumpkin Trader in any town's safe zone and choose": "到任一城鎮的安全區與南瓜商人對話，並選擇",
    "Join the Haunted Hallow": "加入鬧鬼萬聖節",
    ". A party leader can bring the whole party.": "。隊長可以帶領整個隊伍。",
    "Fight in the Ancient Curse and under the Blood Moon: take part for about a minute and deal damage, heal allies under attack, or light three of the glowing pumpkin lanterns during the Curse.": "在古老詛咒與血月下戰鬥：參與約一分鐘並造成傷害、治療受攻擊的隊友，或在詛咒期間點亮三盞發光的南瓜燈籠。",
    "Credit in the Ancient Curse and the Blood Moon of one 30-minute cycle makes a Harvest clear and earns a Golden Pumpkin. Every credited encounter pays Pumpkin Seeds and a candy. Golden Pumpkins are capped at 6 a day per account, from Harvest and Haunted House clears together; after that Harvest clears still count, encounters pay half the seeds and a house clear pays a Silver Pumpkin.": "在同一個 30 分鐘週期內於古老詛咒與血月都獲得貢獻，即算一次豐收完成並獲得金南瓜。每場計入貢獻的遭遇都會給予南瓜種子與糖果。金南瓜每個帳號每天上限 6 個（豐收與鬼屋通關合計）；之後豐收完成仍會計數，遭遇只給一半的種子，鬼屋通關則給銀南瓜。",
    "Spend your seeds at the Pumpkin Traders. Three clears open the Haunted House at Gludio Cemetery.": "在南瓜商人處花費你的種子。通關三次即可開啟古魯丁墓地的鬼屋。",
    "Lich Says, then": "巫妖說，接著",
    "the Horseman.": "無頭騎士。",
    "10:30 PM ET · Lich Says": "22:30 ET · 巫妖說",
    "The Lich runs a game in north Giran plaza. The last three standing win Pumpkin Seeds and a candy.": "巫妖在奇岩北廣場舉辦遊戲。最後存活的三人可獲得南瓜種子與糖果。",
    "11 PM ET · Headless Horseman": "23:00 ET · 無頭騎士",
    "He rides on Giran's east gate on Oct 30, Oct 31, Nov 1, Nov 2, Nov 3, Nov 4, Nov 5, Nov 6, Nov 7, Nov 8 and Nov 9. Standard and Classic fight him together, and everyone who helps earns a reward.": "他於 10/30、10/31、11/1、11/2、11/3、11/4、11/5、11/6、11/7、11/8 與 11/9 騎向奇岩東門。標準與經典一起對戰，所有出力的人都能獲得獎勵。",
    "11 PM CET · European raid": "23:00 CET · 歐洲突襲",
    "He also rides every evening for Europe, with its own Lich Says half an hour before. One Horseman reward per account profile each night.": "他每晚也會為歐洲騎出，半小時前有專屬的巫妖說。每個帳號檔案每晚限領一次無頭騎士獎勵。",
