    "Bonus raid": "額外突襲",
    "If the community reaches 15,000 clears, the Horseman returns on Tue, Nov 10 at 9 PM ET.": "若社群達成 15,000 次通關，無頭騎士將於 11/10（二）21:00 ET 回歸。",
