    "to the hidden Defector in Ivory Tower to create a Forbidden item.": "給象牙塔的隱藏叛逃者，製作禁忌道具。",
    "Chest Spawn Areas": "寶箱出現區域",
    "Forgotten Treasure Chests can appear in five large Forgotten Island regions.": "遺忘寶箱可能出現在遺忘之島的五個大區域。",
