    "Forbidden Item Creation": "禁忌道具製作",
    "The hidden Defector in Ivory Tower accepts any enchant level Ancient item, but the enchant does not carry over. The Forbidden result is created at +0 and can be enchanted unsafely.": "象牙塔的隱藏叛逃者接受任何強化值的古代道具，但強化值不會保留。製作出的禁忌道具為 +0，可進行不安全的強化。",
