    "Both worlds use the": "兩個世界都使用",
    "Both modes coexist on the same server and each has its own economy. Choose your mode at game account creation.": "兩種模式共存於同一伺服器，各有自己的經濟體系。請在建立遊戲帳號時選擇模式。",
    "Forgotten Mambo Rabbits and Maino Shaman": "遺忘的曼波兔與瑪依奴夏門",
    "Pirate Island": "海賊島",
    "Play at your own pace: hunt normally for about 30 minutes to unlock each reward.": "照自己的步調玩：正常打怪約 30 分鐘即可解鎖每一份獎勵。",
    "complete one extra activity block Monday through Friday and one Saturday through Sunday to recover up to two missed days each week.": "週一至週五多完成一個活動時段、週六至週日再一個，每週最多可補回兩天錯過的獎勵。",
    "Progress is once per web account and resets to Day 1 on the first of each month. Abuse may result in account deletion.": "進度以每個網站帳號計一次，每月 1 日重置回第 1 天。濫用可能導致帳號刪除。",
    "Log in to see whether your weekday and weekend catch-ups are available or already used.": "登入後可查看平日與週末的補領是否可用或已使用。",
    "Rune Chest": "符文寶箱",
