    "Pet Match Yellow Gold Medal": "寵物戰的金牌",
    "One random Epic rune": "隨機 1 個史詩符文",
    "Rare champion monsters can appear while hunting, marked by a beam and carrying extra reward chances, including runes.": "打怪時可能出現稀有的冠軍怪物，以光柱標示，並帶有包含符文在內的額外獎勵機會。",
    "Fight ranked 1v1-5v5 matches or larger skirmishes up to 10v10 with ratings and match history.": "參加 1v1 至 5v5 的排位賽，或最多 10v10 的大型遭遇戰，附積分與對戰紀錄。",
    "Auction House, buyouts, bids, stack pricing, price history, and offline shops keep trading active.": "拍賣場、直購、競標、整組定價、價格紀錄與離線商店，讓交易持續活絡。",
    "Castle ownership, siege times, pledge results, and player performance are easy to follow.": "城堡歸屬、攻城時間、血盟戰果與玩家表現一目了然。",
    "Search items, monsters, bosses, drops, rune chances, class spells, pets, shops, commands, and guides.": "搜尋道具、怪物、Boss、掉落、符文機率、職業魔法、寵物、商店、指令與指南。",
    "Optional damage messages, spell alerts, HP bars, dungeon timers, safer rolls, clearer drain messages, and protection against frustrating mishaps.": "可選的傷害訊息、魔法提示、HP 條、地監計時器、更安全的擲骰、更清楚的吸取訊息，以及防止惱人意外的保護。",
    "A weekly Lastavard 4F party gauntlet with sealed rooms, eight Justice bosses, harsher monsters, faster hazards, ground blessings, and leaderboard clears.": "每週一次的拉斯塔巴德 4 樓隊伍闖關：封閉房間、八位暗影法官 Boss、更兇猛的怪物、更快的危險機制、地面祝福與排行榜通關紀錄。",
    "Tool": "工具",
    "Preview class stat changes, level gains, HP and MP outcomes, and candle rebuilds before committing them in game.": "在遊戲裡動手前，先預覽職業能力值變化、升級成長、HP 與 MP 結果以及蠟燭重置。",
    "Compare class weapons with individual enchant and elemental setups, target defenses, class buffs, proc rules, and live damage rankings.": "比較各職業武器在不同強化與屬性配置、目標防禦、職業輔助魔法、觸發規則下的表現，並即時排名傷害。",
    "Hardmode monsters can reveal temporary ground blessings with HP, MP, damage shields, regen, speed, ward, focus, hunter, and class-buff pickups.": "困難模式怪物可能掉出暫時的地面祝福，包括 HP、MP、傷害護盾、回復、速度、守護、專注、獵人與職業輔助等拾取效果。",
    "Open -auto in-game, pick a HP threshold and potion type, then let the server consume real healing potions when needed.": "在遊戲中開啟 -auto，選擇 HP 門檻與藥水種類，之後由伺服器在需要時自動喝下真正的治癒藥水。",
    "Talking Island Dungeon 1F and 2F have been renewed with corroded monsters, key-locked boss rooms, Maya, Baphomet, and Crystal Orb routes into TOI.": "說話之島地監 1 樓與 2 樓已翻新，加入腐蝕怪物、需要鑰匙的 Boss 房、瑪雅、巴風特，以及通往傲慢之塔的水晶球路線。",
    "Tower of Insolence Hard Mode is now in BETA with optional challenge tiers, extra EXP for the risk, and its own leaderboard tracking.": "傲慢之塔困難模式現已進入 BETA，提供可選的挑戰階級、承擔風險的額外經驗值，以及專屬排行榜追蹤。",
    "Ranked 1v1-5v5 Arenas and unranked skirmishes up to 10v10 are live in beta, with leaderboards, game stats, and team management available now.": "1v1 至 5v5 的排位競技場與最多 10v10 的非排位遭遇戰已以 beta 上線，排行榜、對戰數據與隊伍管理現已開放。",
    "Fire Valley and Dragon Valley Caves now have local Hard Mode tiers with boosted rewards, hazards, and dedicated leaderboard tracking.": "火龍窟與龍之谷地監現已加入在地的困難模式階級，附帶加成獎勵、危險機制與專屬排行榜追蹤。",
    "Runes now drop in TOI Hardmode as equipment effects with Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic tiers. Monster and boss rune groups have separate drop pools.": "符文現在會在 TOI 困難模式掉落，作為裝備效果，分為普通、稀有、史詩、傳說與神話五階。怪物與 Boss 的符文群組有各自的掉落池。",
    "New Ancient gear & upgrades as Forbidden gear, Forgotten Treasurechests, Maino Shaman, and Mambo Rabbits.": "新的古代裝備與升級：禁忌裝備、遺忘寶箱、瑪依奴夏門與曼波兔。",
    "Auction House with Offline Shop integration is now live.": "整合離線商店的拍賣場現已上線。",
    "Pets": "寵物",
    "Pet Talents are now live on the website with mixed-tree builds, level-based point unlocks, ultimates at 50, and the level-55 Epic talent path.": "寵物天賦已在網站上線，支援混合天賦樹配置、依等級解鎖點數、50 級終極技能，以及 55 級的史詩天賦路線。",
    "Dragon Belts, rare elixers, stat T-Shirts, and the Dreamwoven T-Shirt path.": "龍之腰帶、稀有萬能藥、能力值 T 恤，以及夢織 T 恤路線。",
    "Offline Shops keep the market moving while players are logged off, and the website now shows active shop characters in their own sorted section.": "離線商店讓玩家下線時市場仍持續運作，網站現在也會在獨立分區顯示開店中的角色。",
    "Rotating Bonus EXP Maps spotlight changing hot zones so players can chase the current boosted leveling route across the world.": "輪替的經驗值加成地圖會標示變動的熱門區域，讓玩家追逐當前加成的練功路線。",
