    "Combat automation, class utilities, spell diagnostics, and controlled testing.": "戰鬥自動化、職業工具、魔法診斷與可控測試。",
    "Choose which combat details, sprites, messages, and world effects you see.": "選擇你要看到的戰鬥細節、圖像、訊息與世界特效。",
