    "Manage items and layouts, visit markets, import bookmarks, and move around Aden.": "管理道具與版面、逛市場、匯入記憶座標，並在亞丁各地移動。",
    "Convenience, appearance, and equipment tools available to active supporters.": "提供給現役贊助者的便利、外觀與裝備工具。",
