    "Allow or prevent your pets and summons from casting spells.": "允許或禁止你的寵物與召喚獸施放魔法。",
    "Switch to each newly tagged target, or finish tagged targets in order.": "切換到每個新標記的目標，或依序解決已標記的目標。",
    "Allow or prevent pet Taunt talent casts.": "允許或禁止寵物施放挑釁天賦。",
    "Broadcast a birthday greeting for 5,000,000 Adena.": "花 5,000,000 金幣廣播生日祝福。",
    "Control the profanity filter for chat you receive.": "控制你收到的聊天內容的髒話過濾。",
