    "Hall of Records.": "紀錄殿堂。",
    "Eight sealed rooms. Eight Justices. One final gate. The names below belong to the parties who crossed the gauntlet fastest and the challengers who kept returning.": "八間封印的房間。八位暗影法官。一道最後的門。下方的名字屬於最快穿越考驗的隊伍，以及一再回來挑戰的人。",
    "Read the Guide": "閱讀指南",
