    "Reborn Feathers (item 41159, Sacred Wing Feather) are a special currency used at the Food Bank and Exotic Pets vendors in town.": "Reborn 羽毛（道具 41159，神聖之翼羽毛）是一種特殊貨幣，可在城鎮的食物銀行與珍奇寵物商人處使用。",
