    "An account is assigned to either the Standard or Classic rate profile. The profiles can occupy the same physical world, but important interactions are separated:": "每個帳號會被指定為標準或經典倍率模式。兩種模式可以在同一個實體世界裡，但重要的互動是分開的：",
