    "Classic and Standard use profile-specific monster ownership, drops, events, trade rules, trade areas, castle treasuries, rankings, and many reward limits.": "經典與標準各自使用自己的怪物歸屬、掉落、活動、交易規則、交易區、城堡金庫、排名，以及許多獎勵上限。",
    "Direct trade is restricted to the same profile. Cross-profile party invitations are blocked.": "直接交易只限同一模式。跨模式的組隊邀請會被擋下。",
