    "Earn their trust.": "贏得他們的信任。",
    "Ordinary enemies of a faction give a little standing when they are near your level, up to Honored. Monsters far below you give less, then nothing.": "與你等級相近的陣營一般敵人會給予少量聲望，最高累積到尊敬。等級遠低於你的怪物給得更少，甚至不給。",
    "Elites and named monsters are worth more and keep counting until Revered.": "精英與有名字的怪物價值更高，並持續計算到崇敬。",
    "Bosses, and trophies handed to the faction's quartermaster, carry you all the way to Exalted.": "Boss，以及交給陣營軍需官的戰利品，能讓你一路累積到崇拜。",
    "Hardmode kills count double, and hardmode monsters fight at the run's level, so they count in full for any level that can enter. Pirate Island Hard Mode is the best place for the Drowned Fleet and the Lizardman Tribe, and Ivory Tower Hard Mode for the Arcanists. Party members on the same screen each earn the full amount for their own level.": "困難模式的擊殺以雙倍計算，且困難模式怪物以該次挑戰的等級戰鬥，因此任何能進入的等級都能完整計算。海賊島困難模式最適合溺亡艦隊與蜥蜴人部族，象牙塔困難模式則適合秘法師。同畫面的隊員各自以自己的等級獲得完整聲望。",
    "Every gain costs half as much standing with the rival faction. You hear about it in chat whenever you reach a new tier.": "每次獲得聲望，敵對陣營的聲望會扣除一半。每當你達到新的階級，聊天視窗都會通知你。",
