    "Your standing": "你的聲望",
    "Double, up to triple on the top tier": "雙倍，最高階級可達三倍",
    "Where you": "看看你",
    "to see the standing of your own characters here.": "即可在此查看你自己角色的聲望。",
    "Ordinary enemies of a faction give a little standing, the most when they are near your level. How far they take you depends on their level: below level 30 up to Friendly, level 30 and up all the way to Exalted. A monster pays in full until you are 10 levels above it, then less, down to a quarter once you are 35 levels above it, and never less; the game tells you when that happens. Each monster's list entry shows the level where it pays only a quarter. Fractions add up from kill to kill, so a monster worth half a point pays one point every second kill.": "陣營的一般敵人會給予少量聲望，等級與你相近時最多。能讓你累積到多高取決於牠們的等級：30 級以下最高到友好，30 級以上則可一路累積到崇拜。在你高出怪物 10 級之前，怪物給予全額聲望，之後逐漸減少，高出 35 級時降到四分之一，不會再更低；發生時遊戲會提示你。每隻怪物的清單項目都標示只給四分之一時的等級。零數會逐次擊殺累加，因此一隻值半點的怪物每兩次擊殺給 1 點。",
    "Elites and named monsters are worth more and count one step further, so even low elites take you to Honored. Every kill in a hardmode run counts double (up to triple on harder tiers) and as a level 30 kill, and every faction monster in Giran Prison counts all the way to Exalted.": "精英與有名字的怪物價值更高，上限也再高一階，因此即使低等級精英也能帶你到尊敬。困難模式挑戰中的每次擊殺以雙倍計算（較高階級最多三倍）並視為 30 級擊殺，而奇岩監獄中的每隻陣營怪物都能一路累積到崇拜。",
    "A Champion of a faction monster pays ten times its reputation, and a Mythic boss five times (the usual limits still apply).": "陣營怪物的冠軍怪物給予十倍聲望，神話 Boss 則為五倍（一般上限仍然適用）。",
    "Hardmode kills count double on the easiest tier and more on harder ones, up to triple on the top tier, and hardmode monsters fight at the run's level, so they count in full for any level that can enter. Pirate Island Hard Mode is the best place for the Drowned Fleet and the Lizardman Tribe, Ivory Tower Hard Mode for the Arcanists, and Orc Fortress Hard Mode for the Children of the Mother Tree. Party members on the same screen each earn the full amount for their own level.": "困難模式的擊殺在最低階級以雙倍計算，階級越高越多，最高階級可達三倍；且困難模式怪物以該次挑戰的等級戰鬥，因此任何能進入的等級都能完整計算。海賊島困難模式最適合溺亡艦隊與蜥蜴人部族，象牙塔困難模式適合秘法師，妖魔城堡困難模式則適合母樹之子。同畫面的隊員各自以自己的等級獲得完整聲望。",
    "Every gain costs half as much standing with the rival faction, except that an ordinary Bandit Syndicate monster costs the Giran City Watch a third of what it pays. You hear about it in chat whenever you reach a new tier.": "每次獲得聲望，敵對陣營的聲望會扣除一半；唯一例外是強盜集團的一般怪物，只會扣除奇岩城衛隊其給予量的三分之一。每當你達到新的階級，聊天視窗都會通知你。",
    "The faction title, its signature rune and its finest stock. 20% off.": "陣營稱號、招牌符文與最頂級的商品。20% 折扣。",
    "The faction earring, ring or pendant and rarer goods. 15% off.": "陣營耳環、戒指或墜飾與更稀有的商品。15% 折扣。",
    "pick your side.": "選邊站。",
    "Monsters to hunt": "狩獵目標",
    "under a faction for every monster that moves it: values are the full amount per kill (less once you are 10 levels above a monster, a quarter from the level shown), and a monster's name opens its map where it spawns most.": "，可查看會影響該陣營的每隻怪物：數值為每次擊殺的全額（高出怪物 10 級後減少，從標示的等級起只剩四分之一），點怪物名稱可開啟牠最常出現的地圖。",
    "Open a rivalry's quartermaster rewards and point at, or tap, an item for its card. Prices are list prices: quartermasters take 5% off at Friendly, 10% at Honored, 15% at Revered and 20% at Exalted. Limits are per character, except the Exalted cloaks: one a month per game account. Weekly limits reset on Monday and monthly ones on the 1st, New York time.": "展開對立關係的軍需官獎勵，將滑鼠移到（或點選）道具即可查看詳細卡片。價格為定價：軍需官在友好時折扣 5%、尊敬 10%、崇敬 15%、崇拜 20%。限購依角色計算，但崇拜斗篷例外：每個遊戲帳號每月一件。每週限購於週一重置、每月限購於 1 日重置，皆為紐約時間。",
    "up to Friendly": "最高到友好",
    "Ice Queen Royal Guard": "冰之女王禁衛兵",
    "Earring · Bound · 52+": "耳環 · 綁定 · 52+",
    "Amulet · Bound · 55+": "項鏈 · 綁定 · 55+",
