    "Each enchant level adds 1 AC and 2 MR, like a Cloak of Magic Resistance.": "每一級強化增加 1 AC 與 2 MR，與魔法抗性斗篷相同。",
    "Pet weapon": "寵物武器",
    "Pet weapon · Bound": "寵物武器 · 綁定",
    "Your pet: +4 hit, +1 damage. While worn it also has the Hunter Instinct talent (+1 hit).": "你的寵物：命中 +4、傷害 +1。裝備時同時擁有獵人本能天賦（命中 +1）。",
    "Pet armor": "寵物護甲",
    "Pet armor · Bound": "寵物護甲 · 綁定",
    "Your pet: AC -16, +1 CON, +5 MR. While worn it also has the Taunt talent: its hits within 2 cells make its target focus on it for 5 seconds (5-second cooldown).": "你的寵物：AC -16、CON +1、MR +5。裝備時同時擁有嘲諷天賦：牠在 2 格內的攻擊會讓目標專注攻擊牠 5 秒（冷卻 5 秒）。",
    "Signature Epic rune": "招牌史詩符文",
    "When a hit would leave you alive but below 100 HP, you are healed for 250 HP before it lands. Works against monsters and players, once every 5 minutes; a hit that would kill you outright does not trigger it. Also +10 max HP.": "當一次攻擊會讓你存活但 HP 低於 100 時，在它命中前先為你恢復 250 HP。對怪物與玩家皆有效，每 5 分鐘一次；會直接讓你死亡的攻擊不會觸發。另外最大 HP +10。",
    "Counts as a Rune of Call to Arms and cannot be worn with one.": "視為號召符文，不能與號召符文同時裝備。",
    "Signature runes are bound to the character, never enter the Rune Gambler, and never stack with their plain rune: only one rune of a family can be worn, whatever its grade.": "招牌符文為角色綁定，不能放入符文賭徒，也不與同系列的一般符文疊加：同一系列不論等級只能裝備一個。",
    "Hand these to the quartermaster. Reputation per item; a capped trophy stops raising standing at the tier shown.": "將這些交給軍需官。數值為每件道具的聲望；有上限的戰利品到了標示的階級就不再提升聲望。",
    "Ring · Bound · 52+": "戒指 · 綁定 · 52+",
    "Monsters whose loot is rolled for you drop 10% more adena. Also +1 CHA.": "掉落判定歸你的怪物多掉 10% 金幣。另外 CHA +1。",
    "Counts as a Wealth rune: cannot be worn with Wealth, Riches or Opulence.": "視為財富系列符文：不能與財富、富裕或奢華符文同時裝備。",
    "Ruby of Taros": "塔洛斯的紅寶石",
    "Sapphire of Taros": "塔洛斯的藍寶石",
    "Emerald of Taros": "塔洛斯的綠寶石",
    "Diamond of Taros": "塔洛斯的鑽石",
    "Priest of Death": "死亡的司祭",
    "Cloak · Bound · 55+ ·": "斗篷 · 綁定 · 55+ ·",
    "· Safe enchant +4": "· 安定值 +4",
    "A Reborn currency. The Skull Shop in Giran sells pet fruits, Crystals of Bravery, Battle Horns and more for Skulls, and the Rune Gambler asks for 1, 3 or 5 per rune upgrade.": "Reborn 的貨幣。奇岩的骷髏商店以骷髏出售寵物果實、勇氣結晶、戰鬥號角等，符文賭徒每次符文升級會收取 1、3 或 5 個。",
    "+5% max HP, +5% max MP and +3 freeze resistance.": "最大 HP +5%、最大 MP +5%、冰凍抗性 +3。",
    "Counts as a Soul rune: cannot be worn with Soul, Greater Soul, Superior Soul or Grand Soul. It adds to Vitality and Spirit runes.": "視為靈魂系列符文：不能與靈魂、高級靈魂、卓越靈魂或特級靈魂符文同時裝備。效果會與活力、精神符文疊加。",
    "up to Honored": "最高到尊敬",
    "+1 percentage point to your weapon's proc chance, so 5% becomes 6%, and +3 blind resistance. Weapons without a proc gain only the resistance.": "武器觸發機率 +1 個百分點，例如 5% 變成 6%，並且失明抗性 +3。沒有觸發效果的武器只獲得抗性。",
    "Counts as a Crescent Moon rune: cannot be worn with Crescent Moon or Greater Crescent Moon.": "視為新月系列符文：不能與新月或高級新月符文同時裝備。",
    "When you die you are offered a resurrection; accepting brings you back with half your max HP, without restoring lost EXP. 6-hour cooldown, shared with Greater Rebirth, starting when the offer appears even if you decline. Not on maps that forbid resurrection. Also +5 water resistance.": "死亡時會跳出復活選項；接受後以一半最大 HP 復活，不會恢復損失的經驗值。冷卻時間 6 小時，與高級重生符文共用，從選項出現時開始計算，即使拒絕也一樣。禁止復活的地圖無效。另外水抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Rebirth rune: cannot be worn with Rebirth or Greater Rebirth.": "視為重生系列符文：不能與重生或高級重生符文同時裝備。",
    "Native`s Totem": "原住民圖騰",
    "Your pet: +2 hit, +2 damage. While worn it also has the Savage Bite talent (+1 damage).": "你的寵物：命中 +2、傷害 +2。裝備時同時擁有野蠻撕咬天賦（傷害 +1）。",
    "+30 max HP, +4 HP regeneration and +3 sleep resistance.": "最大 HP +30、HP 回復 +4、睡眠抗性 +3。",
    "Counts as a Vigor rune: cannot be worn with Vigor, Greater Vigor or Superior Vigor.": "視為生機系列符文：不能與生機、高級生機或卓越生機符文同時裝備。",
    "Your pet: AC -17, +20 MR. While worn it also has the Inner Focus talent (10% less magic damage).": "你的寵物：AC -17、MR +20。裝備時同時擁有內在專注天賦（魔法傷害減少 10%）。",
