    "+2 stun resistance, making Shock Stun, Mass Shock Stun and Bone Break less likely to land on you, and +5 max HP.": "暈眩抗性 +2，使衝擊之暈、Mass Shock Stun 與骷髏毀壞更難命中你，並且最大 HP +5。",
    "Counts as a Tenacity rune: cannot be worn with Tenacity or Grand Tenacity.": "視為堅韌系列符文：不能與堅韌或特級堅韌符文同時裝備。",
    "+10% max HP and +1 MR.": "最大 HP +10%、MR +1。",
    "Counts as a Vitality rune: cannot be worn with Vitality, Greater Vitality, Superior Vitality or Grand Vitality. It adds to a Soul rune.": "視為活力系列符文：不能與活力、高級活力、卓越活力或特級活力符文同時裝備。效果會與靈魂符文疊加。",
    "1 item": "1 件道具",
    "A physical hit on a monster, or an attack spell or Turn Undead cast at monsters, has a 3% chance to restore 2% of your max MP (at least 6). 4-second cooldown; never from scrolls, and only while you are missing MP. Also +3 stone resistance.": "對怪物的物理攻擊，或對怪物施放的攻擊魔法或起死回生術，有 3% 機率恢復最大 MP 的 2%（至少 6）。冷卻 4 秒；卷軸不會觸發，且僅在 MP 未滿時有效。另外石化抗性 +3。",
    "Counts as a Rune of Soulthirst and cannot be worn with one.": "視為渴魂符文，不能與渴魂符文同時裝備。",
    "A physical hit on a monster has a 2% chance to restore 2% of your max HP. 3-second cooldown; only while you are missing HP. Also +5 fire resistance.": "對怪物的物理攻擊有 2% 機率恢復最大 HP 的 2%。冷卻 3 秒；僅在 HP 未滿時有效。另外火抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Rune of Blooddrinker: cannot be worn with Blooddrinker or the Orc Confederacy's Rune of Paagrio's Fury.": "視為嗜血者符文：不能與嗜血者符文或妖魔部族聯盟的 Rune of Paagrio's Fury 同時裝備。",
    "Subterranean Elekkadom": "地底伊萊克頓",
