    "Stone Golem of Maino Shaman": "瑪依奴夏門的石頭高崙",
    "Stone Golem": "石頭高崙",
    "Giant Ant": "巨蟻",
    "+2 damage on every hit against undead, demon and lycanthrope monsters, including attacks, spells, weapon procs and damage over time. Monsters only. Also +5 fire resistance.": "對不死、惡魔與萊肯類怪物的每次攻擊傷害 +2，包含攻擊、魔法、武器觸發與持續傷害。僅對怪物有效。另外火抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Rune of Sanctuary and cannot be worn with one.": "視為聖所符文，不能與聖所符文同時裝備。",
    "+10% max MP and +5 water resistance.": "最大 MP +10%、水抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Spirit rune: cannot be worn with Spirit, Greater Spirit, Superior Spirit or Grand Spirit. It adds to a Soul rune.": "視為精神系列符文：不能與精神、高級精神、卓越精神或特級精神符文同時裝備。效果會與靈魂符文疊加。",
    "Take 7.5% less damage from monsters, but deal 7.5% less damage to them. Damage between players is unchanged. Also +5 earth resistance.": "受到怪物的傷害減少 7.5%，但對怪物造成的傷害也減少 7.5%。玩家之間的傷害不變。另外地抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Chains rune: cannot be worn with Iron, Mithril or Adamantite Chains.": "視為鎖鏈系列符文：不能與鐵鏈、米索莉鎖鏈或亞丁鎖鏈符文同時裝備。",
    "+20% carrying capacity, on top of your other weight bonuses, and +5 wind resistance.": "負重上限 +20%，與你其他的負重加成疊加，並且風抗 +5。",
    "Counts as a Burden rune: cannot be worn with Burden or Larger Burden.": "視為負重系列符文：不能與負重或大負重符文同時裝備。",
