    "Contaminated Ent": "污濁安特",
    "Your pet: +3 hit, +1 damage, +2 SP. While worn it also has the Soul Reservoir talent (+8% max MP).": "你的寵物：命中 +3、傷害 +1、SP +2。裝備時同時擁有靈魂儲槽天賦（最大 MP +8%）。",
    "Your pet: AC -14, +1 WIS, +15 MR. While worn it also has the Spirit Bond talent: every 10 seconds your pet and you regenerate 4% of max HP while it is on your screen.": "你的寵物：AC -14、WIS +1、MR +15。裝備時同時擁有心靈連結天賦：寵物在你畫面上時，每 10 秒你與寵物各恢復最大 HP 的 4%。",
    "Your pets, summons and tamed monsters get +3 percentage points of critical-hit chance against monsters. Also +2 to all four elemental resistances.": "你的寵物、召喚物與馴服的怪物對怪物的爆擊率 +3 個百分點。另外四種屬性抗性各 +2。",
    "Counts as a Feral crit rune: cannot be worn with Feral Instinct, Feral Precision or Feral Savagery.": "視為野性爆擊率系列符文：不能與野性本能、野性精準或野性殘暴符文同時裝備。",
