    "Discover Reborn": "認識 Reborn",
    "Classic Lineage 1 roots, expanded with modern progression, website tools, and live-service systems.": "以經典天堂 1 為根基，加入現代化的成長系統、網站工具與持續營運的機制。",
    "Old-school Lineage with more to chase.": "老派天堂，更多值得追求的目標。",
    "Reborn keeps the familiar Lineage 1 foundation and adds features that make hunting, trading, pledges, PvP, pets, events, and long-term character growth more visible and rewarding.": "Reborn 保留熟悉的天堂 1 基礎，並加入讓狩獵、交易、血盟、PvP、寵物、活動與長期角色成長更清楚、更有回報的功能。",
    "Two separated progression paths on one world.": "同一個世界上兩條分開的成長路線。",
    "Runes + Hardmode": "符文 + 困難模式",
    "Rare powers tied into real hunting progression.": "與實際狩獵進度綁定的稀有力量。",
    "Website Tools": "網站工具",
    "Auction, lookup, guides, pledges, rankings, and stats.": "拍賣、查詢、指南、血盟、排名與數據。",
    "Live Systems": "即時系統",
    "Champions, timers, events, boss cycles, and hunting goals.": "冠軍怪物、計時器、活動、Boss 週期與狩獵目標。",
    "Choose Your Path": "選擇你的路線",
    "Avg. Level:": "平均等級：",
    "Two Progression Paths": "兩條成長路線",
    "Play Standard at x5 EXP or choose Classic at x1 EXP with its own economy, slower pace, and separate market.": "以 x5 經驗值遊玩標準模式，或選擇 x1 經驗值的經典模式，擁有自己的經濟體系、較慢的節奏與獨立市場。",
    "Standard x5 + Classic x1": "標準 x5 + 經典 x1",
    "Transparent EXP Tables": "透明的經驗值表",
    "Compare Standard and Classic leveling side by side before choosing how you want to progress.": "在決定成長方式前，先並排比較標準與經典的升級速度。",
    "Rare Equipment Powers": "稀有裝備力量",
    "Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic runes add new equipment powers for combat, pets, farming, utility, and spell builds.": "普通、稀有、史詩、傳說與神話符文為戰鬥、寵物、打寶、便利與魔法配置加入新的裝備力量。",
    "View Runes": "查看符文",
    "Permanent Challenge Progression": "永久的挑戰進度",
    "A tougher Tower of Insolence challenge with unlocks, special bosses, exclusive rewards, rune drops, timers, and rankings.": "更艱難的傲慢之塔挑戰，有解鎖要素、特殊 Boss、專屬獎勵、符文掉落、計時器與排名。",
    "View Hardmode": "查看困難模式",
    "Rare champion versions of normal monsters can appear with a visible beam, much higher strength, and extra rewards.": "一般怪物可能出現稀有的冠軍版本，帶有明顯光柱、更強的實力與額外獎勵。",
    "Extra Treasure Rolls": "額外的寶物擲骰",
    "Champion Rewards": "冠軍怪物獎勵",
    "Champion monsters can roll bonus rewards on top of their normal drops, including rare rune chances and special hunting prizes.": "冠軍怪物在一般掉落之外還能擲出額外獎勵，包括稀有符文機會與特殊狩獵獎品。",
    "Champion Lookup": "冠軍怪物查詢",
    "Auction House + Offline Shops": "拍賣場 + 離線商店",
    "Player Market": "玩家市場",
    "Buy, bid, sell stacks clearly, use buyouts, check price history, and keep offline shops running while you are away.": "清楚地購買、競標、整組販售，使用直購、查看價格紀錄，並在你離線時讓離線商店持續營業。",
    "Open Market": "前往市場",
    "Player Shop Convenience": "玩家商店便利功能",
    "Trading Zone Tools": "交易區工具",
    "The market area keeps shops organized and lets players teleport directly to a shop by character name.": "市場區讓商店井然有序，玩家可依角色名稱直接傳送到該商店。",
    "Repeatable Hunting Goals": "可重複的狩獵目標",
    "Repeatable monster hunts give steady goals, party-friendly progress, item rewards, and chances at rune rewards.": "可重複的怪物狩獵提供穩定的目標、適合組隊的進度、道具獎勵與符文獎勵機會。",
