    "Level 65-69:": "65-69 級：",
    "Level 70+:": "70 級以上：",
    "Characters under level 52 still do not count for active regular-siege player kill scoring.": "52 級以下的角色在一般攻城中仍不計入玩家擊殺分數。",
    "How winner is decided": "如何決定勝者",
