    "(min 10%).": "（最低 10%）。",
    "Castle indoor regen": "城堡室內回復",
    "applies only to members of the reigning pledge (house-style HP/MP regen).": "只對統治血盟的成員生效（如同房屋的 HP／MP 回復）。",
    "Toy Princess doll perk:": "玩具公主娃娃福利：",
    "members of a castle-owning pledge get double Toy Princess doll stats and EXP bonus while the castle is held.": "擁有城堡期間，該血盟成員的玩具公主娃娃能力值與經驗值加成加倍。",
    "Order guards;": "指揮守衛；",
    "teleport home goes to castle; storage dwarf (not Orc Fortress).": "回家傳送會到城堡；有倉庫矮人（歐克要塞除外）。",
    "Downsides": "缺點",
    "Siege pressure:": "攻城壓力：",
    "you become the main target every cycle.": "每個週期你都是主要目標。",
