    "Weapon Chasers": "武器追擊",
    "These tables show average total 3-hit chaser damage per proc against a player target. Values are generated from live `l1jdb` weapon skill data by a daily cache job and include target MR again.": "這些表格顯示對玩家目標每次觸發的 3 段追擊平均總傷害。數值由每日快取作業從即時的 `l1jdb` 武器技能資料產生，並再次計入目標 MR。",
