    "10F": "10 樓",
    "gate boss on your current tier to unlock": "關卡 Boss 可解鎖",
    "both": "兩者：",
    "the next tier at the altar and": "祭壇上的下一階級，以及同階級的",
    "11F-20F": "11-20 樓",
    "on that same tier.": "。",
    "Clearing later gate floors on that same tier only unlocks the next 10-floor section for that tier.": "擊敗同階級之後的關卡樓層只解鎖該階級的下一個 10 樓區段。",
    "Example: Tier 2, 10F unlocks Tier 3 and Tier 2: 11F-20F. Tier 2, 20F unlocks Tier 2: 21F-30F.": "例：階級 2 的 10 樓解鎖階級 3 與階級 2 的 11-20 樓。階級 2 的 20 樓解鎖階級 2 的 21-30 樓。",
    "Outside help on the gate boss invalidates the attunement clear.": "關卡 Boss 若有外部協助，該次調諧通關無效。",
    "TOI hardmode-exclusive drops are additive. They roll on top of normal loot and scale by both floor bracket and active hardmode tier.": "傲慢之塔困難模式專屬掉落是額外的。在一般戰利品之外另行擲骰，並依樓層區段與進行中的困難模式階級成長。",
