    "Free to play. No pay-to-win. Community guided.": "免費遊玩。沒有課金優勢。由社群引導。",
    "Explore all {n} Reborn highlights": "瀏覽全部 {n} 項 Reborn 特色",
    "{n} highlights": "{n} 項特色",
    "Rotating bonus EXP maps, over 100 kill quests, seasonal events and revamped zones give familiar paths new purpose. Follow your own goals or bring your party.": "輪替的經驗值加成地圖、超過 100 個擊殺任務、季節活動與翻新的區域，讓熟悉的路線有了新目標。追求自己的目標，或帶上你的隊伍。",
    "Hard modes turn familiar territory into a serious challenge: tiered open grounds, timed party expeditions, a nine-tier tower and the weekly Justices raid, each with its own rewards and rankings.": "困難模式把熟悉的地盤變成真正的挑戰：分階級的開放區域、限時的組隊遠征、九階的高塔與每週的暗影法官突襲，各有自己的獎勵與排行榜。",
    "Explore every hard mode": "探索所有困難模式",
